These bin files are data from the hover testing done on July 30th, 2026. 
The drone was filled with 0, 2, 4, 6, 8 and 10 kg payloads during each test cycle. 
The drone was disarmed for 30 seconds to calculate onboard power consumed by electrical components.
It hovered at 5 metres AGL for 2 minutes. 
The ambient wind speed was 3-5 m/s, though my calculations suggest it shouldn't affect power consumption much.  


Initial results are listed below - the bin files have the actual payload weight attached in their names. 

